{"id":"602433be409bad14","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-ultraproduct-elementary.md","title":"Ultraproduct Elementary","display":"Ultraproduct Elementary","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-ultraproduct-elementary","aliases":["93-lem-ultraproduct-elementary"],"display":"Ultraproduct Elementary","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-ultraproduct]]","[[93-lem-los-theorem]]","[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","[[57-df-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-ultraproduct-elementary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-ultraproduct-elementary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Ultraproduct Elementary"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35ef9870c318436f\" href=\"?note=35ef9870c318436f\" title=\"93-df-first-order-ultraproduct\">93-df-first-order-ultraproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e07e37041cb639b\" href=\"?note=4e07e37041cb639b\" title=\"93-lem-los-theorem\">93-lem-los-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"84c35fea1e867240\" href=\"?note=84c35fea1e867240\" title=\"93-df-first-order-formula\">93-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" href=\"?note=7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" title=\"57-df-ultrafilter\">57-df-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-ultraproduct-elementary---Ultraproduct-Elementary\">lem-ultraproduct-elementary - Ultraproduct Elementary</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(I\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\\)</span> for all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}\\)</span> is the first-order ultraproduct constructor.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\\{i\\in I:\\mathfrak A(i)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\\{i\\in I:\\mathfrak A(i)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is the sentence form of Łoś's theorem; elementary transfer is an equivalence, not only its forward direction.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-ultraproduct-elementary---Ultraproduct-Elementary","text":"lem-ultraproduct-elementary - Ultraproduct Elementary","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"35ef9870c318436f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-ultraproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-lem-los-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"4e07e37041cb639b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-lem-los-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"84c35fea1e867240","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A:I\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)","display":false},{"tex":"P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\mathfrak A:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\n\\land P^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\mathfrak A;I)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A(i),\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FOUltProd}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal U;I,\\mathcal L)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\\{i\\in I:\\mathfrak A(i)\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1450,"backlinks":[{"id":"e960a212d7978b44","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["35ef9870c318436f","4e07e37041cb639b","84c35fea1e867240","7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7"]}